# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub Linguist — language statistics configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The `skills/` folder contains large HTML design templates and
# reference files (some 10–20 MB each) that are NOT part of the
# FusionFlow ERP application. Without this file, GitHub shows the
# repo as "HTML" instead of "TypeScript" because Linguist weighs
# languages by total byte size.
#
# Mark these files as vendored so they are excluded from the
# repository's language bar on github.com.
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist#overrides

# Exclude the entire skills/ folder from language stats
skills/**/* linguist-vendored

# Exclude other non-application assets
*.csv linguist-vendored
public/**/* linguist-vendored
download/**/* linguist-vendored
tests/**/* linguist-vendored
examples/**/* linguist-vendored

# Mark generated Prisma client as generated (already in .gitignore,
# but this is a safety net if it ever gets committed)
prisma/migrations/** linguist-generated
